{
 "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
 "$id": "urn:ccg:bundle-v1",
 "title": "ccg fact bundle v1: one record (one JSONL line)",
 "description": "docs/plans/connected-code-graph-bundle-spec.md v1.3, sections 2, 5, 7 and 8. Validates ONE record. Schema validity is necessary but NOT sufficient: ccg/bundle.py adds the file framing and canonical bytes, record order and duplicate ids, every id recomputed through ccg.ids, in-bundle references and the cross-record rules, plus per-record rules this dialect cannot state portably (one encoding per access path: a quoted field segment must not be an identifier; an exact IPv6 test for bindValue). A consumer that validates with this schema alone accepts bundles ccg.bundle rejects.",
 "type": "object",
 "required": [
  "type"
 ],
